 "title": "Grain Marketing Services | Contracts, Storage &amp; Hauling | Premier Cooperative - Premier Co-op",
 "text": "Grain Marketing Services | Contracts, Storage & Hauling | Premier Cooperative - Premier Co-op\nMain\nUtilities\nResidential\nAutomotive Repair\nHardware Stores\nHome heat\nHome Improvement\nAgricultural\nCrop Production\nAnimal Nutrition\nFuels & Lubes\nGrain Marketing\nDetailed Cash Bids\nDetailed Futures\nWeather\nCommercial\nFuels & Lubes\nBuilding Supplies\nCommodity Sourcing\nFleet Repair\nCenex\nContact Us\nCareers\nMember Login\nCash Bids\nDTN Login\nContact Us\nGiving Back\nSubscribe\nMember Login\nCareers\nCash Bids\nBecome a Member\nGrain Marketing\nGather Information | Create a Custom Plan | Execute Your Plan\nDTN LOGIN\nGRAIN ACH FORM\nTrucking\nMarketing\nDrying & Storage\nMobile Friendly Member Login\nWelcome to POCKT! Gain 24/7 access to your grain account. View grain scale tickets, contracts, settlements and more.\nPockt uses the same account number and password as your existing member login.\nPOCKT ACCOUNT ACCESS\nGrain Marketing Services\nTRUCKING\nMARKETING\nDRYING & STORAGE\nCONTACT INFO/HOURS\nTrucking\nWe have over 600 vehicles in our fleet making us one of the largest distributors in the nation.\nTrucking grain is one of our primary activities and takes place year-round including:\nHauling your grain out of your field to one of our elevator facilities.\nHauling your grain from your storage to one of our feed mills for processing.\nHauling your grain to a river terminal or ethanol plant.\nHave your own trucks? We are always looking for trucks and drivers to help meet demand. Leveraging our membership’s assets is another way we drive efficiency in our local economy.\nREQUEST CONSULTATION\nMarketing\nWe have partnered with CHS Inc, a cooperative, to offer Pro Advantage services. We have a full menu of grain contracts including basis, minimum price, fixed price, and hedge to arrive contracts.\nREQUEST CONSULTATION\nGRAIN MARKETING TOOLS\nDrying & Storage\nWe have four regional grain terminals with over 6 million bushels of storage with over 40,000 bushels per hour receiving and capacity and nearly 20,000 bushels per hour of drying capacity. Grain bank is available for feed customers.\nREQUEST CONSULTATION\nContact Info/Hours\nIn-Season Receiving Hours (Hours may vary by location and are subject to change without notice. Please call ahead before delivery. )\nWisconsin Locations\nMon-Fri: 7:30 a.m. - 7:00 p.m.\nSat-Sun: 8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m.\nContact Information:\nMazomanie: ( 608) 767-3801\nMineral Point: (608) 987-3100\nRichland Center: (608) 383-5620\nWestby: (608) 308-4882\nIowa Locations\nMon-Fri 7:30 a.m. - 6:00 p.m.\nSat: 8:00 a.m. - 6:00 p.m.\nSun: 12:00 p.m. - 6:00 p.m\nContact Information:\nFort Atkinson: 563-534-7216\nManchester: 563-927-6050\nNew Albin: 563-544-4242\nOssian: 563-532-9381\nPostville: 563-864-7234\nDuring inclement weather, please contact your location prior to arrival to verify we are able to unload. Premier Cooperative will not unload grain in the rain.\nDATCP Agri-Producer Security Fund Notification\nPremier Cooperative participates in Wisconsin’s Agricultural Producer Security Program. If we fail to pay you for grain when payment is due, you may file a claim under this program. The program may provide some compensation. However, our “estimated default exposure” exceeds program coverage, and we have not filed security to cover the difference, so compensation may cover only a portion of your loss. For more information, you may contact the Wisconsin Department of Agriculture, Trade and Consumer Protection, 2811 Agriculture Drive, P.O. Box 8911, Madison, WI 53708-8911 (phone 608/224-4998).\nComplete the form below to enroll your account to receive payments for grain by ACH.\nACH Form\nSign up for cash bid text marketing today!\nName\nPhone Number\nCell Phone Carrier\nChoose One\nAT&T\nT Mobile\nUS Cellular\nVerizon\nOther\nPrimary Grain Location\nFort Atkinson/Waucoma\nLone Rock\nManchester\nMazomanie\nMineral Point\nNew Albin\nOssian\nPostville\nWestby\nEmail\nSecurity code\nGET HELP PLANNING YOUR PRODUCTION! REQUEST CONSULTATION\n1.888.753.5585\nMEMBER LOGIN\nCONTACT US\nNEWS\nCAREERS\nRESIDENTIAL\nHOME HEAT\nCONVENIENCE STORES\nHOME IMPROVEMENT\nAUTOMOTIVE REPAIR\nAGRICULTURAL\nCROP PRODUCTION\nANIMAL NUTRITION\nFUELS & LUBES\nGRAIN MARKETING\nCOMMERCIAL\nFUELS & LUBES\nBUILDING SUPPLIES\nCOMMODITY SOURCING\nFLEET REPAIR\nConnect with Premier\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Premier Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
